   $q$Which character type from Text 1 does the speaker of Text 2 resemble?$q$, $q$[{"text":"A wise elder who quietly teaches younger characters through example.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-character"},{"text":"A trickster who wins by fooling stronger opponents.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"A loyal helper who gives up a chance to win for a friend.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"A proud newcomer who starts quickly but lacks a strong foundation.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$A proud newcomer who starts quickly but lacks a strong foundation.$q$, $q$Like the pine that "shot upward," the speaker races to "the front of the pack" without the training the seniors have. The seniors, not the speaker, are like the quiet oaks.$q$, 'draft', 'cce15e04-4a2f-5fc0-9fc3-dd9a766dd461')
