   $q$The noise "rolled over her like a wave." What does this simile suggest about the crowd?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The crowd was standing up and moving toward the court in a line.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"The sound was loud and powerful, and it seemed to surround her.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The sound was soft and calming, like water at a quiet beach.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-tone"},{"text":"The crowd grew quiet for a moment before the next serve began.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-target"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The sound was loud and powerful, and it seemed to surround her.$q$, $q$A wave is large and covers whatever it hits, so the simile shows how strongly the crowd noise surrounded Amara in a gym where "the bleachers shook." Nothing suggests the sound was gentle or calming.$q$, 'draft', 'b3d29201-729c-5bf3-ad92-e68fe982d3cb')
