   $q$What is the main purpose of the second paragraph, which describes last spring's game?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It shows that Priya has decided to quit playing in tournaments.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It describes the rules of chess for readers who do not play.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-purpose"},{"text":"It explains why Priya hesitates before taking the bishop this time.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It introduces Daniel as a new player Priya has never faced before.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It explains why Priya hesitates before taking the bishop this time.$q$, $q$The flashback shows Priya losing after grabbing the same bishop, which explains her caution now. Daniel is not new; she played him "last spring, at this same tournament."$q$, 'draft', 'ab4dabcd-6304-5dc8-a039-4a83aae55836')
