   $q$What effect does the countdown structure have on the poem?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It slows the poem down so readers lose interest before the launch.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-meaning"},{"text":"It makes the launch seem like a routine event with no excitement.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-tone"},{"text":"It builds anticipation, moving readers steadily toward the moment of release.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It shows that the students are worried they will run out of time.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It builds anticipation, moving readers steadily toward the moment of release.$q$, $q$Each lower number brings the reader closer to letting go, so excitement builds toward "One." Nothing in the poem says the students fear running out of time.$q$, 'draft', 'af39d5ce-0be5-5dbf-b7b4-3931e2164528')
