   $q$From whose point of view is this story told?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Linh's, in the first person","is_correct":true},{"text":"Mr. Halvorsen's, in the third person","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-point-of-view"},{"text":"An outside narrator who knows every character's thoughts","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-omniscient"},{"text":"The mother's, in the first person","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-narrator"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Linh's, in the first person$q$, $q$The narrator says "my mother" and is the student Mr. Halvorsen calls Linh, so it is Linh's first-person view. We never hear the mother's or the teacher's thoughts directly.$q$, 'draft', '878522c9-b6f8-5d26-9a4e-264b65f9fdcb')
