   $q$Which is the best objective summary of the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Ferreira raised salmon in scented water, added the same scent to a side stream and found that many adults later swam into it.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"Salmon are the smartest fish in the ocean, and it is amazing that they can remember their home after so many years away.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"includes-opinion"},{"text":"Most salmon return to the streams where they hatched. They likely use magnetism at sea and a memorized stream scent near home, as an experiment supports, so protecting stream scents may help them.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Salmon smell their home stream from the open ocean and follow it all the way back, so dams do not affect them.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Most salmon return to the streams where they hatched. They likely use magnetism at sea and a memorized stream scent near home, as an experiment supports, so protecting stream scents may help them.$q$, $q$The third choice covers the homing behavior, both guiding senses, the experiment and the conservation point. The second choice is accurate but describes only the experiment.$q$, 'draft', 'a7518606-4d24-520b-9ca8-67e6ff0874ed')
