   $q$How long has Ms. Takahashi been sending meteor counts to the university?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Forty summers","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"},{"text":"Nine summers","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"},{"text":"Twenty-two summers","is_correct":true},{"text":"Two summers","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Twenty-two summers$q$, $q$The text says she "had been sending meteor counts to the state university for twenty-two summers." Forty, two, and nine are numbers from other details: minutes counted, the hour, and meteors recorded.$q$, 'draft', 'aabf52a7-4a3e-5097-af50-5e286c452e39')
